_N1 = [("Napatay ang tatlong sundalo nang makasagupa ang grupo ng mga rebeldeng New People’s Army sa isang liblib na lugar sa bayan ng Balbalan, Kalinga kamakalawa ng gabi.", "Three soldiers were killed when they clashed with a group of New People’s Army rebels in a remote place in the town of Balbalan, Kalinga, the night before last."), ("Ang mga nasawi ay kinilalang sina Corporal John Rey Dayag, Private First Class Jocel Abbacan at Jordan Bolar.", "The dead were identified as Corporal John Rey Dayag, Private First Class Jocel Abbacan and Jordan Bolar."), ("Batay sa ulat, kahahapunan lang ng mga sundalo nang paulanan ng bala ng rebelde ang patrol base ng ikalimampung Infantry Battalion ng Army.", "According to the report, the soldiers had just had supper when the rebels rained bullets on the patrol base of the Army’s 50th Infantry Battalion, which killed the three soldiers.")]
